{
  "id": "poem-073",
  "body": "<div class=\"poem-text\"><p class=\"poem-stanza\" id=\"verse-1\"><span class=\"poem-line\">向佛陀致敬</span></p><p class=\"poem-stanza\" id=\"verse-2\"><span class=\"poem-line\">从前慢，人心很慢，思维很慢，</span><span class=\"poem-line\">能够感悟佛性的圆满；</span></p><p class=\"poem-stanza\" id=\"verse-3\"><span class=\"poem-line\">从前慢，行走很慢，修行很慢，</span><span class=\"poem-line\">慢得人们才会体悟生命的奥妙。</span><span class=\"poem-line\">后来快，科技已经很快，生活也很快，</span><span class=\"poem-line\">忙碌和浮躁充斥着人们的内心；</span><span class=\"poem-line\">后来快，文化也很快，思想也很快，</span><span class=\"poem-line\">快得人们已经不曾悟得佛性的真谛。</span></p><p class=\"poem-stanza\" id=\"verse-4\"><span class=\"poem-line\">今天慢，宁静很慢，心灵很慢，</span><span class=\"poem-line\">用心去领悟佛性的智慧；</span><span class=\"poem-line\">今天慢，行迹很慢，修心很慢，</span><span class=\"poem-line\">慢得人们才能融入生命的意义。</span><span class=\"poem-line\">向佛陀致敬，领悟生命的真谛，</span><span class=\"poem-line\">走过一段段艰辛的人生之路；</span><span class=\"poem-line\">向佛性致敬，探究生命的奥妙，</span><span class=\"poem-line\">让人生的旅途有光彩，也有坚定。</span><span class=\"poem-line\">正念修行，寻求内心的平静，</span><span class=\"poem-line\">抚平浮躁和短视所带来的疲惫；</span><span class=\"poem-line\">舍离纷扰，融入宁静的清新，</span><span class=\"poem-line\">体悟佛陀教诲的真谛，拥抱实相。</span></p></div><p class=\"poem-original-page\">原书第 73—74 页</p>"
}
